      "content": "i get that but it doesn't feel like i'm growing. it just feels like they're stuck in this loop of cleaning up after me and worrying about me. it's like i've robbed them of their own lives because they're so busy managing mine. i just feel so guilty that i can't give anything back. it's not fair to them.",
