      "content": "it just feels so selfish to stay. like, if i really cared about them, i wouldn't be the reason they're always stressed or tired or stuck. sometimes i wonder if the most unselfish thing a person can do is just... stop being a problem for everyone else. like, if i wasn't here, they could finally just live their own lives without having to fix mine.",
